sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor Student

    participant AcademyUI as Academy Next.js App
    participant API as Go API Core
    participant Academy as Academy Domain
    participant Billing as Billing Domain
    participant Paystack
    participant DB as Aurora PostgreSQL
    participant Redis
    participant Worker as Event Worker


    Student->>AcademyUI: Click Secure Seat

    AcademyUI->>API: POST /api/v2/academy/waitlist/checkout

    API->>Academy: Create Checkout Request

    Academy->>Billing: InitializePayment(amount,email)

    Billing->>Paystack: Create Transaction

    Paystack-->>Billing: Return Authorization URL

    Billing-->>Academy: Return Payment URL

    Academy-->>AcademyUI: Return Payment URL

    AcademyUI->>Student: Redirect To Paystack Checkout


    Student->>Paystack: Complete Payment


    Paystack->>API: Send Payment Webhook

    API->>Billing: Validate Webhook


    Billing->>Paystack: Verify Transaction

    Paystack-->>Billing: Payment Confirmed


    Billing->>DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION

    Billing->>DB: Insert Transaction Record

    Billing->>DB: Insert PaymentReceived Outbox Event

    DB-->>Billing: COMMIT TRANSACTION


    Billing->>Redis: Publish Event Signal

    Redis->>Worker: Trigger Event Processing


    Worker->>DB: Fetch Pending Outbox Event

    Worker->>Academy: Update Waitlist Status

    Worker->>DB: Mark Event Completed